hadiths[91]{hadithnumber,text}:
"959","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"960","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"961","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Abu Salih as-Samman from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"962","Yahya related to me from Abdullah ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Mamar al- Ansari that Ata ibn Yasar said that the Messenger of Allah"
"963","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said"
"964","Yahya related to me from Malik that Zayd ibn Aslam had said that Ubayda ibn al-Jarrah had written to Umar ibn al-Khattab mentioning to him a great array of Byzantine troops and the anxiety they were causing him. Umar ibn al-Khattab wrote in reply to him"
"965","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said that the Messenger of Allah"
"966","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that a son of Kab ibn Malik (Malik believed that ibn Shihab said it was Abd ar-Rahman ibn Kab) said"
"967","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"968","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Abu Bakr as-Siddiq was sending armies to ash-Sham. He went for a walk with Yazid ibn Abi Sufyan who was the commander of one of the battalions. It is claimed that Yazid said to Abu Bakr"
"969","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz wrote to one of his governors"
"970","Yahya related to me from Malik from a man of Kufa that Umar ibn al-Khattab wrote to a lieutenant of an army which he had sent out"
"971","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that when Abdullah ibn Umar gave something in the way of Allah"
"972","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab used to say"
"973","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"974","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that he heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"975","Malik said about enemy soldiers who were found on the seashore of a Muslim land"
"976","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Amr ibn Kathir ibn Aflah from Abu Muhammad"
"977","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad said that he had heard a man asking ibn Abbas about booty. Ibn Abbas said"
"978","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad that Said ibn al- Musayyab said"
"979","Yahya related to me that Malik said that he had heard that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz used to say"
"980","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Said from Amr ibn Shuayb that when the Messenger of Allah"
"981","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban from Ibn Abi Amra that Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani said"
"982","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Abdullah ibn al-Mughira ibn Abi Burda al-Kinani that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"983","Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili from Abu'l-Ghayth Salim"
"984","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Abbas said"
"985","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"986","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"987","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"988","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Umar ibn al-Khattab used to say"
"989","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Said al- Maqburi from Abdullah ibn Abi Qatada that his father had said that a man came to the Messenger of Allah"
"990","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'n-Nadr"
"991","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said"
"992","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Umar ibn al-Khattab used to say"
"993","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"996","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Anas ibn Malik had said that when the Messenger of Allah"
"997","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Abu Salih as-Samman from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"998","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said"
"999","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that the Messenger of Allah"
"1000","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Muadh ibn Jabal said"
"1001","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1002","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1003","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1004","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that the Messenger of Allah"
"1005","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd at-Tawil from Anas ibn Malik that when the Messenger of Allah"
"1006","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Humayd ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1007","Malik was asked whether"
"1008","Yahya related to me from Malik that Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman said"
"1009","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud from Abdullah ibn Abbas that Sad ibn Ubada questioned the Messenger of Allah"
"1010","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr that his paternal aunt related that her grandmother made a vow to walk to the Quba mosque. She died"
"1011","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Abi Habiba said"
"1012","Yahya related to me from Malik that Urwa ibn Udhayna al-Laythi said"
"1014","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said"
"1015","Yahya related to me from Malik that what he preferred of what he had heard from the people of knowledge about a man or woman who vowed to walk to the House of Allah"
"1016","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said heard al-Qasim ibn Muhammad say"
"1017","Yahya related to me from Malik from Talha ibn Abi al-Malik al- Ayli from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad ibn as-Siddiq from A'isha that the Messenger of Allah"
"1018","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha"
"1019","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1020","Yahya related to me from Malik from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1021","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1022","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to do kaffara for a broken oath by feeding ten poor people. Each person got a mudd of wheat. He sometimes freed a slave if he had repeated the oath"
"1023","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Sulayman ibn Yasar said"
"1024","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that one time the Messenger of Allah"
"1025","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1026","Yahya related to me from Malik from Uthman ibn Hafs ibn Umar ibn Khalda that Ibn Shihab had heard that Abu Lubaba ibn Abd al-Mundhir"
"1027","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ayyub ibn Musa from Mansur ibn Abd ar-Rahman al-Hajabi from his mother that A'isha"
"1028","Yahya related to me from Malik from Amr ibn al-Harith from Ubayd ibn Fayruz from al-Bara ibn Azib that the Messenger of Allah"
"1029","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar would guard against animals and camels which were young or had physical defects as sacrifices. Malik said"
"1030","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that one time Abdullah ibn Umar wanted to sacrifice an animal at Madina. Nafi said"
"1031","ahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Bushayr ibn Yasar that Abu Burda ibn Niyar sacrificed an animal before the Messenger of Allah"
"1032","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Abbad ibn Tamin that one time Uwaymir ibn Ashqar sacrificed his animal before the prayer on the morning of the Day of Sacrifice"
"1033","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zubayr al-Makki from Jabir ibn Abdullah that the Messenger of Allah"
"1034","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr that Abdullah ibn Waqid said"
"1035","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman that Abu Said alKhudri returned from a journey and his family gave him some meat. He asked whether it was meat from the sacrifice. They replied that it was. Abu Said said"
"1036","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zubayr al-Makki that Jabir ibn Abdullah said"
"1037","Yahya related to me from Malik from Umara ibn Yasar that Ata ibn Yasar told him that Abu Ayyub al-Ansari had told him"
"1038","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said"
"1039","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1041","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar did not sacrifice for the child in the womb. Malik said"
"1042","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said"
"1043","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Abdullah ibn Ayyash ibn Abi Rabia al-Makhzumi ordered one of his slaves to slaughter an animal. When he wanted to slaughter it"
"1044","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that a man from the Ansar of the tribe of Banu Haritha was herding a pregnant she-camel at Uhud. It was about to die"
"1045","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from a man of the Ansar from Muadh ibn Sad or Sad ibn Muadh that a slave-girl of Kab ibn Malik was herding some sheep at Sal (a mountain near Madina). One of the sheep was about to die"
"1046","Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili that Abdullah ibn Abbas was asked about animals slaughtered by the Christian Arabs. He said"
"1047","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Abbas used to say"
"1048","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1049","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Abu Murra"
"1050","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1051","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusayt al-Laythi that Said ibn al- Musayyab said"
"1052","ahya related to me from Malik that Nafi said"
"1053","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad disapproved of eating game that had been killed with throwing sticks and by clay pellets"